			"Message": "build(Echo): Update Documentation/Rust submodule to latest\n\nSynchronize the Rust documentation submodule (Documentation/Rust) to commit 8732e834, advancing from 1c19365f. This ensures Echo's development documentation remains aligned with the latest Rust language and tooling standards referenced in the project's technical guidelines.\n\nNo functional code changes in the current commit.",
